{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/2a570cf6b44c88a2d6315cf1383d9f38.avif?t=1770891499\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>Join a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure: a story-driven, point-and-click experience designed for players who enjoy exploration, observation, and clever problem-solving. You\u2019ll search richly detailed scenes to find cleverly concealed objects, interact with the environment, and solve a variety of mini-games and puzzles that move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/4bf4c7a5b470c59d7eb9d31d81215cef.poster.avif?t=1770891499\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/4bf4c7a5b470c59d7eb9d31d81215cef.webm?t=1770891499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/4bf4c7a5b470c59d7eb9d31d81215cef.mp4?t=1770891499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the desert begins to stir and ancient stone awakens, an ordinary expedition turns into something far more dangerous. After a mysterious mural reacts to her touch, Alice is marked by glowing symbols and separated from her partner, Caleb, who vanishes during the chaos. Stranded in a sun-scorched land shaped by prophecy and hidden portals known as the Gates, Alice must uncover their truth, and decide whether the power bound to her is a gift or a curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/990dffb487e14c8123df2b1acfde59bc.poster.avif?t=1770891499\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/990dffb487e14c8123df2b1acfde59bc.webm?t=1770891499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991890/extras/990dffb487e14c8123df2b1acfde59bc.mp4?t=1770891499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of engaging challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to inventive mini-games. Every location tests your attention, logic, and curiosity, ensuring the gameplay stays fresh and rewarding throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Solve dozens of mini-games and logic puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Explore richly interactive locations filled with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Find hidden objects, collectibles, and optional discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Travel through sweeping deserts, lost temples, and lively markets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Decode glowing symbols and uncover the ancient lore of the Gates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Make branching choices that influence your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Face desert raiders and uncover allies in unexpected places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Unlock achievements to mark your progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 Piece together the truth behind Caleb\u2019s disappearance and the power now coursing through you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond the veil of sand and sunlight, where every hidden detail matters, every choice has weight, and the desert is watching.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BEAST OF THE DESERT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea